\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-90979a7 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"90979a7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7bf4bac e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"7bf4bac\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b08a927 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"b08a927\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Sıcaklık gösterge etiketleri</strong>, belirli bir sıcaklık seviyesine ulaşıldığında renk değiştirerek veya kalıcı iz bırakarak sıcaklık takibi sağlayan pratik ve güvenilir ölçüm çözümleridir. Elektronik sensör gerektirmeden çalışır ve özellikle <strong>endüstriyel ekipmanlar, boru hatları, motorlar, elektrik panoları ve sevkiyat süreçlerinde</strong> hızlı kontrol imkânı sunar.</p><p>HD Marine sıcaklık gösterge etiketleri, <strong>aşırı ısınma tespiti</strong>, <strong>proses kontrolü</strong>, <strong>bakım planlaması</strong> ve <strong>nakliye güvenliği</strong> için etkili bir çözümdür.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f037858 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"f037858\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"174\" src=\"https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/1-hover-3-300x174.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium wp-image-1842\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/1-hover-3-300x174.jpg 300w, https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/1-hover-3-768x444.jpg 768w, https://hdmarine.com.tr/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/1-hover-3.jpg 980w\" sizes=\"100vw\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9006ff2 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"9006ff2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1759d6d elementor-view-stacked elementor-position-inline-start elementor-tablet-position-inline-end elementor-shape-circle elementor-mobile-position-block-start elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon-box\" data-id=\"1759d6d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon-box.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<span  class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-table\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M464 32H48C21.49 32 0 53.49 0 80v352c0 26.51 21.49 48 48 48h416c26.51 0 48-21.49 48-48V80c0-26.51-21.49-48-48-48zM224 416H64v-96h160v96zm0-160H64v-96h160v96zm224 160H288v-96h160v96zm0-160H288v-96h160v96z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-box-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-icon-box-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span  >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTermal Etiket Değer Tablosu\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a2ad604 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"a2ad604\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table width=\"450\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"189\">Özellik</td><td width=\"261\">Değer</td></tr><tr><td width=\"189\">Ürün Tipi</td><td width=\"261\">Sıcaklık Gösterge Etiketi</td></tr><tr><td width=\"189\">Ölçüm Aralığı</td><td width=\"261\">30°C – 260°C (modele göre)</td></tr><tr><td width=\"189\">Tepki Tipi</td><td width=\"261\">Renk değişimi (geri dönüşümsüz ve geri dönüşümlü)</td></tr><tr><td width=\"189\">Kademeli Gösterge</td><td width=\"261\">1 – 10 kademeli seçenek</td></tr><tr><td width=\"189\">Hassasiyet</td><td width=\"261\">±1°C – ±2°C</td></tr><tr><td width=\"189\">Yapışkan Tipi</td><td width=\"261\">Yüksek ısı dayanımlı endüstriyel yapışkan</td></tr><tr><td width=\"189\">Kullanım Süresi</td><td width=\"261\">Tek kullanımlık</td></tr><tr><td width=\"189\">Uygulama Alanı</td><td width=\"261\">Motor, pano, boru, sevkiyat</td></tr></tbody></table>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-804ae43 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"804ae43\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6fa7b8e e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6fa7b8e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3ca663a e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"3ca663a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a7a0a03 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"a7a0a03\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Sıcaklık Gösterge Etiketi Nedir?</h2>\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e7f47ce elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"e7f47ce